OL,3,GNEWSACancer 'not the death sentence it
OL,4,Amight have been'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartine Legg was diagnosed with breast
OL,7,Fcancer in March of this year, but is
OL,8,Fnow back on stage acting in a play with
OL,9,Fthe Guernsey Amateur Dramatic and
OL,10,FOperatic Club.
OL,12,FFor Breast Cancer Awareness Month, Legg
OL,13,Fsaid she wanted those facing such a
OL,14,Fdiagnosis to know that "it's not a
OL,15,Fdeath sentence that it might have been
OL,16,Fyears ago".
OL,18,FBreast cancer is Guernsey's third most
OL,19,Fcommon cancer, causing about 12 to 13
OL,20,Fdeaths a year.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
